message: "If you use OptJV3 in your research, please cite the software and the associated publication."

title: "OptJV3: A Genetic Algorithm Optimizer for JARVIS3"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-18

authors:
  - family-names: "Ferrolho"
    given-names: "Rita"

  - family-names: "Pinho"
    given-names: "Armando J."

  - family-names: "Pratas"
    given-names: "Diogo"

abstract: "OptJV3 is a thread-parallel genetic algorithm optimizer for discovering high-performing JARVIS3 compression parameter sets. It searches over global mixer parameters, context models, and repeat models to optimize lossless compression performance."

keywords:
  - genomic data compression
  - lossless compression
  - genetic algorithms
  - bioinformatics
  - JARVIS3
  - optimization

